    "Terminal split: 0 panes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端分屏：0 个窗格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal theming follows your Ghostty configuration. Browse [all built-in themes](https://iterm2colorschemes.com/), then add a dual-theme line such as:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端主题跟随你的 Ghostty 配置。浏览[所有内置主题](https://iterm2colorschemes.com/)，然后添加类似这样的双主题配置行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Agent Profile Prowl starts for this role." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prowl 为此角色启动的 Agent 配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent will use the runtime's least-restricted mode. It may execute commands and modify files without prompting; managed or user-defined runtime policies can still apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 将使用运行时限制最少的模式。它可能会在不提示的情况下执行命令和修改文件；受管理或用户定义的运行时策略仍可能适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cached pull request has no base branch yet. Refresh pull request status and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缓存的拉取请求尚无基础分支。请刷新拉取请求状态后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The change applies the next time Prowl starts; quitting the app may interrupt running terminal tasks." : {
      "comment" : "App language setting footer: Restart requirement and terminal task warning",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改将在下次启动 Prowl 时生效；退出应用可能会中断正在运行的终端任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code expired. Refresh to create a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配对码已过期。刷新即可创建新的配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The configured worktree base %@ does not exist locally. Fetch it, or update the base branch in the repository's settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已配置的 worktree 基准 %@ 在本地不存在。请获取它，或在仓库设置中更新基础分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current options never reach this role, so no agent is started for it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前选项下不会用到此角色，因此不会为它启动 Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device can now connect to this Mac and select a pane." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该设备现在可以连接到这台 Mac 并选择窗格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device is disconnected and must pair again before it can mirror this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该设备将被断开，须重新配对后才能镜像这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The eight-character code shown on Host under Add a Device.\nIt expires after 60 seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主机上“添加设备”中显示的八位配对码。\n60 秒后过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language will switch on next launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将在下次启动时切换语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link at %@ points at an app that is gone. Participants deliver their results through prowl, so a run cannot start until it is repaired." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 处的链接指向一个已不存在的应用。参与者通过 prowl 交付结果，因此在修复之前无法开始运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link at %@ points at something that is not an executable command. Participants deliver their results through prowl, so a run cannot start until it is replaced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 处的链接指向的不是可执行命令。参与者通过 prowl 交付结果，因此在替换之前无法开始运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is shown instead of %@ on this Mac only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此名称仅在这台 Mac 上代替 %@ 显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network port other Prowl apps connect to" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他 Prowl 连接时使用的网络端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pane this run starts from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次运行的起始窗格。"
